---
interface Props {
  image: {key:string;file:string;outputPath:string;width:number;height:number};
  title: string; description: string; category?:string; instance:string;
  materialId?:string; beforeId?:string;
}
const {image,title,description,category,instance,materialId,beforeId}=Astro.props;
const enabled=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_DAEJEON_REVIEW_ASSETS==='true';
const href=`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,'')}/${image.outputPath}`;
const dialogId=`l02-card-${instance}-${image.key}`;
---
<article class="lesson02-asset-card" data-material-id={materialId} data-before-id={beforeId} data-asset-file={image.file}>
  {enabled ? <img src={href} alt={title} width={image.width} height={image.height} loading="lazy" /> : <p>원본 이미지는 로컬 검수용 화면에서 제공합니다.</p>}
  <div class="lesson02-asset-copy">
    {materialId && <p class="lesson02-asset-id">{materialId}</p>}
    <h4>{title}</h4>
    <p data-asset-description>{description}</p>
    {category && <p class="lesson02-category" data-asset-category>{category}</p>}
    {enabled && <div class="lesson02-asset-actions">
      <button type="button" data-asset-open={dialogId} aria-haspopup="dialog">확대 보기</button>
      <a href={href} download={image.file}>원본 PNG 다운로드</a>
    </div>}
  </div>
  {enabled && <dialog id={dialogId} class="lesson02-asset-dialog" aria-labelledby={`${dialogId}-title`}>
    <header><h3 id={`${dialogId}-title`}>{materialId && `${materialId} · `}{title}</h3><button type="button" data-asset-size aria-pressed="false">원본 크기로 보기</button><button type="button" data-asset-close>닫기</button></header>
    <div class="lesson02-dialog-scroll"><img src={href} alt={title} width={image.width} height={image.height} /></div>
    <p>Esc 키로 닫습니다. 원본 크기에서는 이미지 안에서 가로·세로로 이동할 수 있습니다.</p>
  </dialog>}
</article>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-asset-open]').forEach(opener=>{
    const dialog=document.getElementById(opener.dataset.assetOpen||'') as HTMLDialogElement|null;
    if(!dialog)return;
    opener.addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.showModal());
    dialog.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-asset-close]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.close());
    dialog.addEventListener('close',()=>opener.focus());
    const size=dialog.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-asset-size]');
    size?.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const original=dialog.classList.toggle('is-original');
      size.textContent=original?'화면에 맞춰 보기':'원본 크기로 보기';
      size.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(original));
    });
  });
</script>
